# React + TypeScript

- Functional components only; prefer named exports.
- Strict typing — no `any`. Prefer `unknown` + narrowing for errors.
- Extract data/side effects into hooks; keep JSX declarative.
- Forms: associated labels, keyboard Enter-to-send on composer, visible focus states.
- Prefer early returns over deep nesting.
- Decode untrusted display text safely (e.g. HTML entities from seed data) without `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` unless justified.
